\hline
Aleatório & 24.960.120 & 13.681.366 & 45,19\% \\
Tartarugas & 30.613.750 & 18.133.750 & 40,77\% \\
Zigue-zague & 24.997.500 & 2.501 & 99,99\%\textsuperscript{*} \\
Quase ordenado & 654.922 & 377.149 & 42,41\% \\
Duplicados & 16.633.993 & 6.300.346 & 62,12\% \\
